<title>NORWAY: Norway December Unemployment 3.6 pct - Labour Directorate.</title>
<headline>Norway December Unemployment 3.6 pct - Labour Directorate.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 DEC 1996   NOV 1996    DEC 1995</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	    3.6	  3.5	   4.1</p>
<p> Unemployed			  78,800     77,100	88,591</p>
</text>
